#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:1
msgid "UCM Store Deployment Guide"
msgstr "UCM 存储部署指南"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:3
msgid "Why Use UCM"
msgstr "为什么使用 UCM"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:5
msgid ""
"Unified Cache Manager (UCM) provides an external KV-cache storage layer "
"designed for prefix-caching scenarios in vLLM/vLLM-Ascend. Unlike KV "
"Pooling, which expands prefix-cache capacity only by aggregating device "
"memory and therefore remains limited by HBM/DRAM size and lacks persistence,"
" UCM decouples compute from storage and adopts a tiered design. Each node "
"uses local DRAM as a fast cache, while a shared backend—such as NFS, 3FS, or"
" enterprise-grade storage—serves as the persistent KV store."
msgstr ""
"统一缓存管理器（UCM）提供了一个外部 KV 缓存存储层，专为 vLLM/vLLM-Ascend "
"中的前缀缓存场景设计。与仅通过聚合设备内存来扩展前缀缓存容量、因此仍受 HBM/DRAM 大小限制且缺乏持久性的 KV 池化不同，UCM "
"将计算与存储解耦，并采用分层设计。每个节点使用本地 DRAM 作为快速缓存，而共享后端（如 NFS、3FS 或企业级存储）则作为持久化 KV 存储。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:7
msgid "**Key benefits of using UCM:**"
msgstr "**使用 UCM 的主要优势：**"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:9
msgid ""
"**Breaks Device Memory Capacity Limits**: Traditional prefix caching is "
"constrained by HBM/DRAM size. UCM removes this ceiling by offloading KV "
"cache to external storage, enabling cache capacity to scale with the storage"
" system rather than with compute resources."
msgstr ""
"**突破设备内存容量限制**：传统前缀缓存受限于 HBM/DRAM 大小。UCM 通过将 KV "
"缓存卸载到外部存储来消除这一上限，使缓存容量能够随存储系统而非计算资源扩展。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:11
msgid ""
"**Persistent and Reliable KV Cache**: UCM provides durable KV cache storage,"
" ensuring that cached prefix blocks survive across service restarts, "
"instance failures, or scheduling migrations. This is critical for "
"production-grade inference systems."
msgstr ""
"**持久且可靠的 KV 缓存**：UCM 提供持久的 KV 缓存存储，确保缓存的 prefix "
"块在服务重启、实例故障或调度迁移后仍然存在。这对生产级推理系统至关重要。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:13
msgid ""
"**Multi-Scenario Acceleration**: UCM not only supports prefix caching but "
"also offers training-free sparse attention methods (e.g., GSA, CacheBlend) "
"for handling extremely long sequence inference tasks. Additionally, UCM "
"provides PD disaggregation solutions based on storage-compute separation "
"architecture, enabling flexible management of heterogeneous computing "
"resources."
msgstr ""
"**多场景加速**：UCM 不仅支持前缀缓存，还提供无需训练的稀疏注意力方法（如 GSA、CacheBlend）用于处理超长序列推理任务。此外，UCM "
"基于存算分离架构提供 PD 分离解决方案，支持灵活管理异构计算资源。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:15
msgid ""
"**Significant Performance Improvement**: When integrated with vLLM, UCM "
"achieves **3-10x reduction** in inference latency across various scenarios, "
"including multi-turn dialogue and long-context reasoning tasks. Benchmarks "
"show up to **8x improvement in TTFT** for prefix caching scenarios."
msgstr ""
"**显著的性能提升**：与 vLLM 集成后，UCM 在多轮对话和长上下文推理等多种场景下实现了推理延迟的 **3-10 "
"倍降低**。基准测试显示，在前缀缓存场景中，TTFT 提升高达 **8 倍**。"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:17
msgid "How UCM Works"
msgstr "UCM 工作原理"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:19
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:21
msgid ""
"UCM adopts a **centralized architecture** for KV cache management, "
"constructing a three-tier cache hierarchy:"
msgstr "UCM 采用**集中式架构**进行 KV 缓存管理，构建了三级缓存层次结构："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:27
msgid "This three-tier design enables:"
msgstr "这种三级设计实现了："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:29
msgid "**HBM (Tier 1)**: Fastest access for active inference computation"
msgstr "**HBM（第1层）**：为活跃推理计算提供最快访问"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:30
msgid ""
"**DRAM (Tier 2)**: High-speed local cache for frequently accessed KV blocks"
msgstr "**DRAM（第2层）**：为频繁访问的 KV 块提供高速本地缓存"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:31
msgid ""
"**Storage Backend (Tier 3)**: Persistent storage layer including local SSD, "
"NFS-mounted storage, or dedicated systems like 3FS for unlimited capacity "
"scaling"
msgstr "**存储后端（第3层）**：持久化存储层，包括本地 SSD、NFS 挂载存储或 3FS 等专用系统，支持无限容量扩展"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:33
msgid ""
"UCM chose the centralized approach (similar to DeepSeek's 3FS) over "
"decentralized designs for several reasons:"
msgstr "UCM 选择集中式方法（类似于 DeepSeek 的 3FS）而非去中心化设计，原因如下："

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:35
msgid ""
"**Simplicity**: Avoids complex affinity scheduling required in decentralized"
" architectures"
msgstr "**简洁性**：避免了去中心化架构中所需的复杂亲和性调度"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:36
msgid ""
"**Decoupling**: Keeps inference instances independent without reporting KV "
"cache status to schedulers"
msgstr "**解耦**：保持推理实例独立，无需向调度器报告 KV 缓存状态"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:37
msgid ""
"**No Data Silos**: Centralized storage prevents redundant KV cache "
"accumulation across isolated instances"
msgstr "**无数据孤岛**：集中式存储防止了跨隔离实例的冗余 KV 缓存积累"

#: ../../source/user_guide/feature_guide/ucm_deployment.md:38
msgid ""
"**Better Compatibility**: Superior compatibility with PD disaggregation and "
"large-scale deployment"
msgstr "**更好的兼容性**：与 PD 分离和大规模部署具有卓越的兼容性"

