" Mooncake. For installation details, refer to [kvcache-"
"ai/Mooncake](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake)."
msgstr ""
"**注意**：从vLLM-Ascend 0.11.0开始，官方镜像已预装Mooncake。安装详情请参考[kvcache-"
"ai/Mooncake](https://github.com/kvcache-ai/Mooncake)。"

